- [ ] Block/chart/ui sources sit under `…/<name>/`
- [ ] Docs chrome with 2+ files sits under `components/<feature>/`
- [ ] Imports and `scripts/registry-items.mjs` paths updated
- [ ] Barrel `index.ts` when it clarifies the public entry

